#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "A check sets a component's state without anyone's hand, and Yuva tells your team when it goes down or up."
msgstr "Semakan menetapkan status komponen tanpa campur tangan sesiapa, dan Yuva memberitahu pasukan anda apabila komponen itu gagal atau pulih."

#: src/copy/home.ts
msgid "a contact and their data"
msgstr "satu kenalan dan datanya"

#: src/copy/home.ts
msgid "A conversation in the {platform} SDK: a question about an order and the team's replies with a tracking link, and a box to write back."
msgstr "Perbualan dalam SDK {platform}: soalan tentang pesanan dan balasan pasukan dengan pautan penjejakan, serta kotak untuk membalas."

#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "A customer can dismiss it. It returns when the incident gets a new update."
msgstr "Pelanggan boleh menolaknya. Ia muncul semula apabila insiden mendapat kemas kini baharu."

#: src/copy/cloudflare-email.ts
msgid "A customer writes to one of your support addresses, for example support@example.com."
msgstr "Seorang pelanggan menulis kepada salah satu alamat sokongan anda, contohnya support@example.com."

#: src/copy/home.ts
msgid "A finished import in the panel: 6 conversations and 12 messages copied from an mbox file, with a note that Yuva has no access to your mailbox."
msgstr "Import yang selesai di panel: 6 perbualan dan 12 mesej disalin daripada fail mbox, dengan nota bahawa Yuva tiada akses ke peti mel anda."

#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "A footer band: a coloured square and the state in words, a strip of 90 days with the uptime, and Status by Yuva."
msgstr "Jalur pengaki: petak berwarna dan status dalam perkataan, jalur 90 hari dengan masa operasi, dan Status by Yuva."

#: src/copy/contact.ts
msgid "A hosted service and commercial licenses"
msgstr "Perkhidmatan terhos dan lesen komersial"

#: src/copy/cloudflare-email.ts
msgid "A message can be up to 25 MiB including attachments, which is the Cloudflare Email Routing limit. Yuva keeps up to 50 attachments per message, each within the server's attachment size limit (25 MiB by default) and allowed types; it leaves out the rest."
msgstr "Satu mesej boleh mencapai 25 MiB termasuk lampiran, iaitu had Cloudflare Email Routing. Yuva menyimpan sehingga 50 lampiran bagi setiap mesej, setiap satu dalam had saiz lampiran pelayan (25 MiB secara lalai) dan jenis yang dibenarkan; selebihnya ditinggalkan."

#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "A notice waits 60 seconds so you can undo it, and notices about one incident keep their distance, so a long outage does not flood inboxes."
msgstr "Pemberitahuan menunggu 60 saat supaya anda boleh membatalkannya, dan pemberitahuan tentang satu insiden diberi jarak, supaya gangguan panjang tidak membanjiri peti masuk."

#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "A page stays private until you publish it, and your team previews it in the panel before that."
msgstr "Halaman kekal peribadi sehingga anda menerbitkannya, dan pasukan anda melihat pratontonnya di panel sebelum itu."

#: src/copy/shadcn.ts
msgid "A project that already uses shadcn/ui, with React and Tailwind CSS."
msgstr "Projek yang sudah menggunakan shadcn/ui, dengan React dan Tailwind CSS."

#: src/copy/home.ts
msgid "A public page for the state of your products, kept in the same inbox as your support. Checks keep it current and subscribers hear by e-mail."
msgstr "Halaman awam tentang keadaan produk anda, dalam peti masuk yang sama dengan sokongan anda. Semakan memastikannya terkini dan pelanggan langganan tahu melalui e-mel."

#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "A public status page with components, incidents, maintenance and history, kept current by checks and by your team. E-mail subscribers, a line in the chat widget and the apps, and one reply to everyone who wrote."
msgstr "Halaman status awam dengan komponen, insiden, penyelenggaraan dan sejarah, dikekalkan terkini oleh semakan dan pasukan anda. Pelanggan e-mel, satu baris dalam widget sembang dan aplikasi, dan satu balasan untuk semua yang menulis."

#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "A sample status page: the overall state, an open incident and four components with their last 90 days as coloured bars."
msgstr "Contoh halaman status: status keseluruhan, satu insiden terbuka dan empat komponen dengan 90 hari terakhirnya sebagai bar berwarna."

#: src/copy/cloudflare-email.ts
msgid "A small open-source Worker"
msgstr "Worker sumber terbuka yang kecil"

#: src/copy/shadcn.ts
msgid "A Yuva chat channel and its public key (yuva_pk_…)."
msgstr "Saluran sembang Yuva dan kunci awamnya (yuva_pk_…)."

#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "A Yuva status page shows whether your product works. It sits in your support inbox, so your chat widget and apps show an open incident, and one reply answers everyone who wrote about it."
msgstr "Halaman status Yuva menunjukkan sama ada produk anda berfungsi. Ia berada dalam peti masuk sokongan anda, jadi widget sembang dan aplikasi memaparkan insiden terbuka, dan satu balasan sampai kepada semua yang menulis tentangnya."

#: src/copy/home.ts
msgid "Accepted answer"
msgstr "Jawapan diterima"

#: src/copy/shadcn.ts
msgid "Add every origin that will show the components as an allowed origin: your site and your development server."
msgstr "Tambah setiap origin yang akan memaparkan komponen sebagai origin yang dibenarkan: tapak anda dan pelayan pembangunan anda."

#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "Add it for a second row with each component's state."
msgstr "Tambahkan untuk baris kedua dengan status setiap komponen."

#: src/copy/home.ts
